        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;---\ntitle: SalesOrder State Machine\n---\nstateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --&gt; PendingApproval : Sales creates order (assisted / offline submit)\n\n    PendingApproval --&gt; PendingAllocation : Admin/Operator approve (holds NO stock)\n    PendingApproval --&gt; Rejected : reject (reason required)\n    PendingApproval --&gt; Cancelled : cancel (Sales own / Admin / Operator)\n\n    PendingAllocation --&gt; Approved : daily allocation run approved (plan + prices)\n    PendingAllocation --&gt; Cancelled : cancel before run commitment\n    PendingAllocation --&gt; Rejected : reject\n\n    Approved --&gt; Picking : first warehouse QR pick scan\n    Picking --&gt; Issued : every warehouse portion issued at dispatch (F96)\n    Issued --&gt; Delivering : dispatched to retailer\n    Delivering --&gt; Delivered : retailer confirms full receipt of all portions\n\n    Rejected --&gt; [*]\n    Cancelled --&gt; [*]\n    Delivered --&gt; [*]\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null,&#xa;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;12&quot;&#xa;}" id="CkZkOW_nSKsX9zHLW-VX-1">
